<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 357-day T-bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 357-day T-bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction 357-day discount bills on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It last sold 280 trillion lira nominal-valued 11-month T-bills on July 15.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : July 29, 1998.</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: August 5, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : August 6, 1997. -- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
